{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810930/extras/Anim3_2_1.gif?t=1749830705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810930/extras/Steam_page_text1.png?t=1749830705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand and personalize your shop by purchasing shelves, refrigerators, and essential licenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your inventory, set competitive prices, and craft strategies to attract more customers and boost your income.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810930/extras/Anim2_1.gif?t=1749830705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810930/extras/Steam_page_text2.png?t=1749830705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with three intricately developed female characters, each with her own rich backstory and unique approach to relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic, evolving personal stories that are shaped by your choices and interactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810930/extras/Anim3.gif?t=1749830705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810930/extras/Steam_page_text3.png?t=1749830705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle unexpected challenges and events that test your business acumen and relationship skills.</p></li></ul><p clas